{
  "schema": 1,
  "why": "Pipeline spec v1 (docs/shader.md#pipeline-spec, plans/m4.md M4.P06): the base pack's colour targets as resources and one pass per program in frame order, under shader/shaders/ (the root the overworld's, world-1 the Nether's, world1 the End's). tests/test_pipeline.py keeps it equal to the pack: each resource's format and clear as the pack sets them, history where a pass reads last frame's values (none yet); per pass its dimensions, the samplers and uniforms its two stages declare at the defaults over its folders, its outputs (RENDERTARGETS; none for the shadow pass's empty DRAWBUFFERS), the options that change its code, budget null until M4.P11's cost rows (D84), every view of its dimensions until M4.P08's coverage list.",
  "pack": "optilux",
  "cycle": 1,
  "cycleWhy": "BENCH_DETERMINISTIC's cycle in frames: the pack reads no term that moves from frame to frame, so a frame repeats every frame (docs/shader.md#determinism-and-taa).",
  "views": "bench_263",
  "viewsWhy": "v0: a pass lists every view of its dimensions in config/views/bench_263.json; M4's coverage list narrows each to the views whose frames show it (docs/shader.md#coverage-list).",
  "resources": [
    {
      "name": "scene",
      "buffer": "colortex0",
      "format": "R11F_G11F_B10F",
      "clear": false,
      "history": false,
      "scale": 1.0,
      "why": "the HDR scene (plans/m4.md D78): deferred writes every pixel, the forward programs blend over it after; never cleared, as deferred covers it"
    },
    {
      "name": "gbuffer",
      "buffer": "colortex1",
      "format": "RGBA16UI",
      "clear": false,
      "history": false,
      "scale": 1.0,
      "why": "the G-buffer's 64 bits (D75, lib/gbuffer.glsl): every opaque draw writes it whole, blending bypassed; never cleared, as Iris's float clear is undefined on it (P14), so deferred reads it only where depth shows geometry"
    },
    {
      "name": "early",
      "buffer": "colortex2",
      "format": "R11F_G11F_B10F",
      "clear": [
        0.0,
        0.0,
        0.0,
        0.0
      ],
      "history": false,
      "scale": 1.0,
      "why": "the sun and moon (skytextured), which deferred adds at the sky's pixels, and under LIGHT_PATH 0 the opaque surfaces lit in their own programs; cleared to 0"
    },
    {
      "name": "mod",
      "buffer": "colortex3",
      "format": "RGBA8",
      "clear": [
        1.0,
        1.0,
        1.0,
        1.0
      ],
      "history": false,
      "scale": 1.0,
      "why": "D76's multiplied overlay (crumbling, M4.P07), applied to the albedo before lighting; cleared to white"
    },
    {
      "name": "emit",
      "buffer": "colortex4",
      "format": "R11F_G11F_B10F",
      "clear": [
        0.0,
        0.0,
        0.0,
        0.0
      ],
      "history": false,
      "scale": 1.0,
      "why": "D76's added overlay (the shield and trim glint pass, M4.P07), added after lighting; cleared to 0"
    },
    {
      "name": "trans",
      "buffer": "colortex5",
      "format": "RGBA16F",
      "clear": [
        0.0,
        0.0,
        0.0,
        0.0
      ],
      "history": false,
      "scale": 1.0,
      "why": "D76's premultiplied overlay (banner patterns, armour cracks, M4.P07), put over the lit scene; cleared to 0"
    },
    {
      "name": "display",
      "buffer": "colortex6",
      "format": "RGB10_A2",
      "clear": false,
      "history": false,
      "scale": 1.0,
      "why": "the tonemapped, sRGB-encoded frame final dithers onto the screen; never cleared, as composite covers it"
    }
  ],
